  pages:
  - title: LEVEL 7 | Voltage Divider | Overview
    explanation: 'Correct completed circuit: Battery+ -> Switch -> replaceable upper
      R1 220 Ohm -> VOUT -> fixed lower R2 330 Ohm -> Battery_negative. Initial R1
      is 330 Ohm; replace with 220 Ohm to target VOUT=3.00 V. LCD measures across
      R2 and never substitutes for the real ground return.'
    caption: PAGE 1/4 | SERIES 220 + 330 Ohm | 5 V SUPPLY
    parts:
    - id: battery
      kind: 0
      position: {x: 0.11, y: 0.51}
      label: 5 V SUPPLY
      color: {r: 0.99, g: 0.3, b: 0.4, a: 1}
