  - title: LEVEL 7 | Exact Five Wiring Connections
    explanation: 1 SwitchOutput -> R1 Register_Input. 2 R1 Register_Output -> R2
      Register_Input (VOUT). 3 R2 Register_Output -> Battery_negative. 4 LCD_Terminal_A
      -> shared VOUT node. 5 LCD_Terminal_B -> Battery_negative. Battery positive
      to switch input is assumed prewired. R1 and R2 need an actual conducting series
      return independent of the LCD.
    caption: PAGE 2/4 | FIVE WIRES AFTER BATTERY+ TO SWITCH INPUT
    parts:
    - id: battery
