  - title: LEVEL 7 | Expected Electrical Measurements
    explanation: 'NOMINAL ESTIMATES, NOT LIVE MEASUREMENTS. At 5 V, upper R1 220
      Ohm and lower R2 330 Ohm: total I=5/(220+330)=9.09 mA; drop across R1=2.00
      V; across R2 and VOUT to ground=3.00 V. AutoVoltageAndComponentCurrent: LCD
      A=VOUT, B=GND, component current reference=fixed R2.'
    caption: PAGE 3/4 | VOUT 3.00 V | I 9.09 mA | 5 V
