  - title: LEVEL 7 | Solution & Four Objectives
    explanation: Replace upper R1 330 Ohm with 220 Ohm. Check 1 fixed R2 conducting;
      2 R2 voltage between 2.90 and 3.10 V; 3 R2 current between 8 and 10 mA; 4 verified
      source current between 8 and 10 mA. Use maximum-value toggles. Source current
      orientation must match evaluator rules. Existing level evaluator remains sole
      victory authority.
    caption: PAGE 4/4 | 220 + 330 Ohm | VOUT 2.90-3.10 V
    parts:
    - id: battery
      kind: 0
      position: {x: 0.11, y: 0.51}
      label: 5 V SUPPLY
